Nginx Container on App Server 3
Problem: Pull nginx:alpine-perl image on Application Server 3. Create a container named cluster using the image. Map host port 6400 to container port 80.

Solution:

bash
# Pull the image
docker pull nginx:alpine-perl

# Create and run container
docker run -d --name cluster -p 6400:80 nginx:alpine-perl

# Verify
docker ps
curl http://localhost:6400
